    "biography": "<h2>Witch - Hexshot — Build Guide</h2>\n<p><em>Core Rulebook v3 Alpha 3, Appendix C. This Hero is built at Level 1 with no Ancestry — pick one, rename the Hero, and adjust anything you like.</em></p>\n<h3>Stats at Level 10</h3>\n<p><strong>MIT</strong> 4 · <strong>DEX</strong> 7 · <strong>AWR</strong> 7 · <strong>RSN</strong> 2 · <strong>PRS</strong> 4 · <strong>LUK</strong> 5</p>\n<h3>Perks by Level</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>1st:</strong> Gish, Witchsight <em>(already on this sheet)</em></li>\n<li><strong>3rd:</strong> Steady Aim</li>\n<li><strong>5th:</strong> Akimbo Trigger</li>\n<li><strong>7th:</strong> Marksmanship</li>\n<li><strong>9th:</strong> Ricochet</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Spells</h3><p>Blink, Fear, Guide, Hold; get Dispel, Fade, Sleep, and Zap later</p>",
