        "description": "<p><strong>Wouldst thou like to live deliciously?</strong></p><p><em>—Robert Eggers, The VVitch</em></p><p>Witches are mediaries of magical secrets. One may become a witch through the whispers of a familiar or the favor of a being from beyond.</p><h3>Iconic Witches</h3><ul><li><strong>Dr. Facilier</strong>, <em>The Princess and the Frog</em></li><li><strong>Sabrina Spellman</strong>, <em>Sabrina the Teenage Witch</em></li><li><strong>The Morrigan</strong>, <em>Celtic mythology</em></li><li><strong>Yubaba</strong>, <em>Spirited Away</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Witch</h3><p>The witch is a debuffer focused on Casting Spells to stack detriments. Stick to the shadows and pile on Statuses through Hex.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Cast<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Backline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Fortune Teller or Mage<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Awareness<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Craft, Mysticism</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Spells</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Mana</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Cast Max</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Occultist, Hex</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Widdershins (1)</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>12</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Grudge Bearer (+1)</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>16</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>7</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Widdershins (2), Soul Link</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>24</p></td><td><p>8</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>28</p></td><td><p>9<